# Brand Identity — Nice Price Bazar

The brand is based on the real shop sign:
- Red signage
- Yellow background
- Local bazar / affordable shop feeling
- Practical household, toys, family products, daily goods

## Brand colors

Use these theme tokens as the starting point:

- brandRed: #C8102E
- brandYellow: #FFD21E
- deepRed: #7A1020
- warmCream: #FFF8E7
- charcoal: #1F1F1F
- mutedBrown: #6B4A2D
- successGreen: #2E9D58
- warningOrange: #F59E0B

## Usage rules

Use red for:
- brand identity
- important highlights
- selected navigation state
- key badges
- primary brand moments

Use yellow for:
- deal banners
- promo cards
- price highlights
- small warm accents

Use cream for:
- screen background
- calm content surfaces

Use charcoal for:
- readable text
- product names
- important labels

Do NOT:
- make every screen bright red/yellow
- copy Amazon colors directly
- use too many gradients
- use random colors per screen
- use glass effects on every card
- make text unreadable on yellow/red

## Visual style

The app should combine:
- iOS premium layout
- local bazar warmth
- modern shopping app clarity
- subtle Liquid Glass-inspired navigation and floating controls

## Logo / name

Use “Nice Price Bazar” as the shop-facing brand.
Use “DoubleA” only as the software/company/internal builder brand where needed.